<div class="mandarin-hanzi">工作</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">gōngzuò</div>

''Meaning:'' work; job; to work  
''Part of speech:'' noun; verb

!! In context
他今天不工作，在家休息。 — Tā jīntiān bù gōngzuò, zài jiā xiūxi. — He isn’t working today; he is resting at home.

!! Usage note
Both a noun ('job; work') and a verb ('work'). Compare 这是我的工作 (Zhè shì wǒ de gōngzuò, 'This is my job').
